= Lord Carrington

[? if con_in_government = 0 : Leader of the Opposition in the Lords. ?][? if con_in_government = 1 : Foreign Secretary. ?] Witty, aristocratic and unflappable, Carrington is one of the few people who can tell you you're wrong and stay a friend.

- @diplomacy
- @lords
